Cell["Conclusions", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.988668818704975*^9, 3.988668820238318*^9}, {
  3.988727941380597*^9, 
  3.9887279420608053`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"3da86578-4867-45ec-9340-\
167d2d57c16d"],

Cell["\<\
Even for very short-lifespan tests (even only two steps!!!), this technique \
doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t seem to lock on to any specific solution. It may be \
possible to apply an activation function for a shaper distinction between \
black and white to significantly improve this technique.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.98866882201735*^9, 
  3.9886689145635967`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"42cdbc79-7c36-487b-9b8f-\
c407cebbe695"]
}, Open  ]]
